# Stage artifacts (raw pages, chunks, embeddings, Chroma store, manifest) are committed:
# reviewers can inspect every stage, and the Vercel API serves from data/chroma/.
# Retrieval logs are runtime output; only the ones cited in Docs/sample_qa.md are force-added.
*.tmp
data/retrieval_logs/*
!data/retrieval_logs/.gitkeep
